    "description": "Stands above the terminal while this window only reads. The ordinary case: humanitl run holds the writer of the session it started, and the window attached with Open.read_only instead of showing a refusal. Not a finding, so it wears the neutral chrome rather than the colour of an error (docs/UX.md rules 5 and 6)."
  },
  "sandboxTerminalMenu": "Terminal menu",
