  "setupStartNotMeasured": "Nothing was measured for {row}, so nothing about it is known. Measure it above, then this button turns on.",
  "@setupStartNotMeasured": {
    "description": "The line under a disabled start button when a row carries no measurement at all -- the model server nobody asked to contact, the folder nobody chose, a machine line nobody could read. It names the row and points at the one control in that row that measures it, because a grey button without a reason is worse than no button (docs/UX.md 5.3).",
    "placeholders": {"row": {"type": "String"}}
  },
  "setupStartWarned": "{row} was measured and is not in order. Fix what the row says, then this button turns on.",
  "@setupStartWarned": {
