  "setupStartCallFailed": "The last request to the background service did not arrive, so nothing started. Nothing about the four rows changed; the finding is below.",
  "@setupStartCallFailed": {"description": "The line under the start button when all four rows are green but the last Sandbox call failed in transport. It says what did not happen and, because a failure of the call says nothing about the folder, the machine or the model server, that the rows still stand (docs/UX.md 4.4)."},
  "setupStartRefused": "The start did not come up, so no agent is running. Nothing about the four rows changed; the finding is below.",
  "@setupStartRefused": {"description": "The line under the start button when the daemon answered a Sandbox(Start) with a finding instead of a running sandbox - a guarantee that did not hold, a launcher that would not run. It is the counterpart of setupStartCallFailed, which is about a call that never arrived (docs/UX.md 4.4)."},
  "interceptDiagnosticOpenFlow": "Open request",
