  "@interceptBodyRecorderStopped": {
    "description": "Above a body the recorder did not store to the end (BodyRef.truncated), in the queue and in the history alike. An incomplete body must never look complete (CONVENTIONS 4.13); this names the recorder, not the transport or this view.",
