  "shellPaletteAbout": "About Humanitl",
  "@shellPaletteAbout": {"description": "Command palette entry that opens the About dialog: name, version, the program's licence, the attribution of the bundled popularity ranking and the button to the licence page (HUM-031). It needs no background service and is offered during a break of the connection too."},
  "aboutLegalese": "Free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 only (GPL-3.0-only). It comes without any warranty.",
  "@aboutLegalese": {"description": "The program's own licence in the About dialog and at the top of the licence page. The SPDX identifier GPL-3.0-only stays verbatim; the file LICENSE in the repository is the full text (HUM-031)."},
  "aboutRanks": "The popularity ranks are an excerpt of the Majestic Million by Majestic-12 Ltd., https://majestic.com/reports/majestic-million, used under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported licence (CC BY 3.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/. Humanitl ships ranks 1 to 100,000, cut down to rank and domain; every change is listed under “Majestic Million” on the licence page.",
  "@aboutRanks": {"description": "CC BY 3.0 attribution of the bundled popularity ranking in the About dialog (catalog/RANKS-LICENSE). It must name the source, the licence with its link, and that the shipped file is an edited excerpt. Keep both addresses, the name Majestic Million and CC BY 3.0 verbatim: they are the attribution the licence asks for, and the licence page lists the entry under that name (HUM-031)."},
  "historyDetailNote": "Note to the agent: {note}",
