    "description": "One line under the decision in the history detail: the sentence the person wrote to the agent when they blocked the request. It is shown only when there is one, as plain text and never as markup, exactly as the agent read it in the 403 response (HUM-072, HUM-117).",
    "placeholders": {"note": {"type": "String"}}
  },

