  "diagSANDBOX034Title": "Selected sandbox backend not available",
  "@diagSANDBOX034Title": {"description": "Title of the diagnostic SANDBOX_034 (docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md): sandbox.backend names a backend this system cannot run; the start never switches to another one (HUM-431)."},
  "diagSANDBOX034Why": "The chosen sandbox backend is not available on this system. The session does not start, and it does not switch to another backend on its own; set the backend to auto to use the backend of this system.",
  "@diagSANDBOX034Why": {"description": "Generic cause of SANDBOX_034. Stands in the cause slot only when the diagnostic carries no sentence of the daemon's own (HUM-052)."},
  "diagSANDBOX035Title": "Sandbox backend below the isolation floor",
  "@diagSANDBOX035Title": {"description": "Title of the diagnostic SANDBOX_035 (docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md): the chosen backend isolates less than sandbox.min_isolation demands (HUM-431)."},
  "diagSANDBOX035Why": "The chosen sandbox backend isolates less than the minimum isolation level asks for. The strictest level of all settings applies, and a project may raise it. The session does not start with a weaker backend.",
  "@diagSANDBOX035Why": {"description": "Generic cause of SANDBOX_035. Stands in the cause slot only when the diagnostic carries no sentence of the daemon's own (HUM-052)."},
  "diagSANDBOX036Title": "Sandbox profile requires another backend",
  "@diagSANDBOX036Title": {"description": "Title of the diagnostic SANDBOX_036 (docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md): the sandbox profile names a backend, and the settings chose another (HUM-431)."},
  "diagSANDBOX036Why": "The sandbox profile requires a different backend than the one chosen in the settings. Neither overrides the other, so the session does not start.",
  "@diagSANDBOX036Why": {"description": "Generic cause of SANDBOX_036. Stands in the cause slot only when the diagnostic carries no sentence of the daemon's own (HUM-052)."},
  "diagSANDBOX048Title": "Sandbox backend not admitted yet",
  "@diagSANDBOX048Title": {"description": "Title of the diagnostic SANDBOX_048 (docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md): the chosen isolation level is not admitted until its escape suite is green in CI (HUM-431)."},
  "diagSANDBOX048Why": "The chosen sandbox backend is not admitted yet. A backend becomes selectable only after the escape tests against it pass; until then no session starts with it. Set the backend to auto to use the backend of this system.",
  "@diagSANDBOX048Why": {"description": "Generic cause of SANDBOX_048. Stands in the cause slot only when the diagnostic carries no sentence of the daemon's own (HUM-052)."},
  "diagSANDBOX037Title": "Podman too old or without crun",
  "@diagSANDBOX037Title": {"description": "Title of the diagnostic SANDBOX_037 (docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md): the installed Podman is older than 4.9 or its OCI runtime is not crun (HUM-433)."},
  "diagSANDBOX037Why": "The Podman backend needs Podman 4.9 or newer with the OCI runtime crun. The installed Podman is older, uses another runtime or did not answer, so the session does not start.",
  "@diagSANDBOX037Why": {"description": "Generic cause of SANDBOX_037. Stands in the cause slot only when the diagnostic carries no sentence of the daemon's own (HUM-052)."},
  "diagSANDBOX038Title": "Podman not rootless or not local",
  "@diagSANDBOX038Title": {"description": "Title of the diagnostic SANDBOX_038 (docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md): Podman runs as root or is only the client of a remote service (HUM-433)."},
  "diagSANDBOX038Why": "The sandbox needs rootless Podman on this computer, started by Humanitl itself. The found Podman runs as root or talks to a remote service such as a Podman machine.",
  "@diagSANDBOX038Why": {"description": "Generic cause of SANDBOX_038. Stands in the cause slot only when the diagnostic carries no sentence of the daemon's own (HUM-052)."},
  "diagSANDBOX039Title": "No subordinate IDs for the container",
  "@diagSANDBOX039Title": {"description": "Title of the diagnostic SANDBOX_039 (docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md): /etc/subuid, /etc/subgid or newuidmap and newgidmap are missing for --userns keep-id (HUM-433)."},
  "diagSANDBOX039Why": "Rootless Podman needs at least 65536 subordinate user and group IDs for your user in /etc/subuid and /etc/subgid, and the helpers newuidmap and newgidmap. One of them is missing.",
  "@diagSANDBOX039Why": {"description": "Generic cause of SANDBOX_039. Stands in the cause slot only when the diagnostic carries no sentence of the daemon's own (HUM-052)."},
  "diagSANDBOX040Title": "Container limits cannot be enforced",
  "@diagSANDBOX040Title": {"description": "Title of the diagnostic SANDBOX_040 (docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md): the cgroup controllers memory, pids and cpu are not delegated (HUM-433)."},
  "diagSANDBOX040Why": "A Podman sandbox runs with a memory, CPU and process limit, and the cgroup controllers for them are not delegated to your user. Without its limits the sandbox does not start.",
  "@diagSANDBOX040Why": {"description": "Generic cause of SANDBOX_040. Stands in the cause slot only when the diagnostic carries no sentence of the daemon's own (HUM-052)."},
  "diagSANDBOX041Title": "Container of an earlier session found",
  "@diagSANDBOX041Title": {"description": "Title of the diagnostic SANDBOX_041 (docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md): a warning: a container carrying the label of this daemon outlived its session (HUM-433)."},
  "diagSANDBOX041Why": "A container of an earlier session of this daemon was still there, for example after a crash. The daemon removed it at its start, or says that it could not.",
  "@diagSANDBOX041Why": {"description": "Generic cause of SANDBOX_041. Stands in the cause slot only when the diagnostic carries no sentence of the daemon's own (HUM-052)."},
  "diagSANDBOX044Title": "SELinux would relabel the project",
  "@diagSANDBOX044Title": {"description": "Title of the diagnostic SANDBOX_044 (docs/DIAGNOSTICS.md): SELinux is enforcing, and binding the project would need relabelling it (HUM-433)."},
  "diagSANDBOX044Why": "SELinux enforces labels on this computer. A container could read the project only after relabelling it, which changes your files, so the Podman backend does not start here.",
  "@diagSANDBOX044Why": {"description": "Generic cause of SANDBOX_044. Stands in the cause slot only when the diagnostic carries no sentence of the daemon's own (HUM-052)."},
